sangati dravya

  -- dravya: substance — the substratum in which qualities inhere and actions occur.
  -- nine dravyas: prithvi, ap, tejas, vayu, akasha, kaala, dik, atman, manas.
  -- "ball", "object", "body" in a physics question — each is a dravya.
  -- padartha-amsha: dravya is one of the seven padarthas.

  "padartha-amsha"
  "guna-yukta karma-yukta samavaya-yukta"
  "pratyaksha-siddha"

done
